markdown <<MARKDOWN
You are helping a boba shop learn from its sales data.

**☑️ Do This:**
- Open [this spreadsheet](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1VLxxwZLiKwF4k-EVJYHFvNUJG6_Q0bT9/view?usp=sharing) containing data for the boba shop.
- Look at a few different rows of data in the dataset, exploring each row’s values.
- In **Step 2** of your Project Planning Guide, write down at least three questions that could be answered by the dataset. Choose questions for which the answers might be useful to the boba shop!

MARKDOWN
